      "field": "description",
      "value": "Students following Variant 2 are provided the opportunity to deepen their subject-specific knowledge by attending additional courses offered as elective modules 5, 6, 7, and 8 of the Master’s program in Southeast Asian Studies or to engage with self-chosen topics in other disciplines.",
